# Fixture: the WP closes only by summing a *lower* bound (the arg's declared
# nonnegativity). The written class-(b) procedure is an upper-bound sum over
# declared max bounds; no lower-bound rule is stated, so the harness must not
# report this as licensed as written.
field Limit as decimal default 10.0

rule Limit >= 0 because "a limit is never negative"

event Reduce(NewLimit as decimal nonnegative)
on Reduce -> set Limit = Reduce.NewLimit
